  <jpcrp030000-asr_E05163-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row17Member">当社グループは同社にシステム開発の委託を行っております。同社との継続的な関係維持・強化のため、当事業年度より同社株式を保有しております。</jpcrp030000-asr_E05163-000:PurposeOfShareholdingOverviewOfBusinessAllianceQuantitativeEffectsOfShareholdingAndReasonForIncreaseInNumberOfSharesDetailsOfSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
